    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/b7f02e7cfd7a924bfe6762212a31219a.avif?t=1692694734\" /></span><br>No matter how skilled you are, a single strike is all it takes to bring about your demise! End of Edge, developed by LIGHTSPEED STUDIOS, is an adrenaline-pumping Wuxia-themed action game that will put your abilities to the test. Fight against overwhelming odds in this exhilarating over-the-top show of martial arts combat, where a single hit can mean life or death.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Hardcore Action] With every breath held, a well-executed slash is your path to victory.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/bd5a1c66c6e7f0101501c18e0aed8387.poster.avif?t=1692694734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/bd5a1c66c6e7f0101501c18e0aed8387.webm?t=1692694734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/bd5a1c66c6e7f0101501c18e0aed8387.mp4?t=1692694734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Diverse Weapons] Embrace your unique fighting style for maximum enjoyment.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/119737a3906de9ec909184fb885ad753.poster.avif?t=1692694734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/119737a3906de9ec909184fb885ad753.webm?t=1692694734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/119737a3906de9ec909184fb885ad753.mp4?t=1692694734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Authentic Wuxia Adventure] Immerse yourself in a captivating story that unfolds amidst the ever-changing tides of destiny.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/f3a5125a02295b68bbcf5b50636584c3.poster.avif?t=1692694734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/f3a5125a02295b68bbcf5b50636584c3.webm?t=1692694734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/f3a5125a02295b68bbcf5b50636584c3.mp4?t=1692694734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Retro Aesthetic] Experience a simplified narrative that places classic Wuxia elements at its core.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/5f3230c6d578ad788edc3fedef50fd8c.poster.avif?t=1692694734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/5f3230c6d578ad788edc3fedef50fd8c.webm?t=1692694734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/5f3230c6d578ad788edc3fedef50fd8c.mp4?t=1692694734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Fusion Style Sound Design] Indulge in the fusion of Chinese electronic music and traditional sounds.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/4290ca083495286ad5668b167ac3ab94.poster.avif?t=1692694734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/4290ca083495286ad5668b167ac3ab94.webm?t=1692694734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/4290ca083495286ad5668b167ac3ab94.mp4?t=1692694734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/b7f02e7cfd7a924bfe6762212a31219a.avif?t=1692694734\" /></span><br>No matter how skilled you are, a single strike is all it takes to bring about your demise! End of Edge, developed by LIGHTSPEED STUDIOS, is an adrenaline-pumping Wuxia-themed action game that will put your abilities to the test. Fight against overwhelming odds in this exhilarating over-the-top show of martial arts combat, where a single hit can mean life or death.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Hardcore Action] With every breath held, a well-executed slash is your path to victory.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/bd5a1c66c6e7f0101501c18e0aed8387.poster.avif?t=1692694734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/bd5a1c66c6e7f0101501c18e0aed8387.webm?t=1692694734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/bd5a1c66c6e7f0101501c18e0aed8387.mp4?t=1692694734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Diverse Weapons] Embrace your unique fighting style for maximum enjoyment.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/119737a3906de9ec909184fb885ad753.poster.avif?t=1692694734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/119737a3906de9ec909184fb885ad753.webm?t=1692694734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450570/extras/119737a3906de9ec909184fb885ad753.mp4?t=1692694734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></